# TestJavaToKotlinLangchain4jNullability: langchain4j-core printed as Kotlin with NullabilityPass (KOTLIN) verdicts,
# judged by kotlinc 2.4.0 and by langchain4j-core's own tests (see maddi-run-openjdk's JavaToKotlinRatchet). Lower is
# better for printerCrashes and syntaxErrors, higher for syntaxCleanFiles, compilingFiles, bytecodeFiles,
# testsPassing, testBytecodeFiles and translatedTestsPassing; `types` must not move. Write a better value here in the
# commit that earns it.
#
# 2026-10-09, first record, corpus at dab06ac18, maddi-mod devel 8f813d5f with maddi's import-computer fix: 346 types,
# all syntax-clean; 189 compiling against the original classes (460 type errors: 173 of them Java annotation
# declarations, which the printer does not translate yet; 14 element nullability through invariant Mutable*
# collections, the modification side's work list), 166 to class files. The tests: 1,111 pass on the original classes
# (5 skipped), 1,057 with the Kotlin classes in front; of 172 test files 116 compile, and with those 1,023 pass.
# 2026-10-09, maddi prints Java annotation types as annotation classes (the scanner keeps the elements' defaults)
# and spreads a renamed String.formatted's varargs: 276 files compiling (202 type errors), 240 to class files. The
# tests go DOWN, knowingly, with 87 more Kotlin classes in front: 1,033 pass with the Kotlin classes (24 builder
# setters judged non-null are handed null by the tests; 18 boxed parameters judged non-null turn primitive in the JVM
# signature, so the Java tests miss the method); 115 test files compile, and with those 992 pass.
# 2026-10-09, maddi-mod 7c73f6ae (an analysed call's result flows into an argument where its links are empty: the
# Json*Schema builders' description parameters nullable) with maddi 3f3faedd7 (a nullable parameter beside a varargs
# overload keeps Java's choice): 200 type errors; 1,063 tests pass with the Kotlin classes, 1,022 translated.
